§ `s 3 -- tax-free threshold`

#ASSERT `the tax-free threshold` EQUALS 18200

§ `Schedule 7 Part I -- which table applies to the year`

#CHECK `the Part I table applicable to the year of income` 2023
#ASSERT `the Part I table applicable to the year of income` 2024 EQUALS `Part I, for the 2024-25 or 2025-26 year of income`
#ASSERT `the Part I table applicable to the year of income` 2025 EQUALS `Part I, for the 2024-25 or 2025-26 year of income`
#ASSERT `the Part I table applicable to the year of income` 2026 EQUALS `Part I, for the 2026-27 year of income`
#ASSERT `the Part I table applicable to the year of income` 2033 EQUALS `Part I, for the 2027-28 year of income or a later year of income`

§ `s 3 -- second and third resident personal tax rates`

#ASSERT `the second resident personal tax rate for` 2024 EQUALS 30%
#ASSERT `the third resident personal tax rate for` 2027 EQUALS 37%

